      "label": "Description",
      "searchable": true,
      "value": "A poster for the Auckland Industrial and Mining Exhibition. The poster includes many Māori illustrations including depictions of Māori in waka on the sea, Māori village life, and other Māori and scenic images. The illustration also includes an image of a ponga tree, with a Māori warrior beside it, advertising 'cheap trips from all parts of the colonies' and the catchphrase 'New Zealand will demonstrate resources & possibilities'."
